# Day-to-day: LLM tool-calling loop with a cycle (model -> tool -> model) and a termination decision.
title "Tool-calling loop"
dir RIGHT
prompt(User prompt)
llm[LLM] :purple
decide{Tool call?} :yellow
tool[Tool runtime] :orange
result[Tool result]
final(Final answer) :green
prompt -> llm
llm -> decide : response
decide -> tool : yes
tool -> result
result -> llm : append to context
decide -> final : no
